    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="9.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VAtr">V Atr</ref> 9.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ se þe þæs geswican wille ⁊ clænnesse healdan, habbe he Godes mildse, ⁊ þar to eacan to worldwurðscipe þæt he sy þegenweres ⁊ þegenrihtes wurðe, ge on life ge on legere.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">But he who will turn from marriage and observe celibacy shall obtain the favour of God, and in addition, as worldly honour, he shall enjoy the wergeld and the privileges of the thegn, both during his life and after his death.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ se ðe þæs geswican wille ⁊ clænnesse healdan, hæbbe he Godes miltse, ⁊ þær to eacan to woroldweorðscype, þæt he sy þegenweres ⁊ þegenrihtes wyrðe, ge on life ge on legere.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
